# The API image builds from the repository root (docker build -f
# apps/api/Dockerfile ., and App Platform's source_dir: /), so this file has to
# live here, at the root of the build context. Everything is left out, then
# only what apps/api/Dockerfile copies is let back in: a .env file, the web app
# and node_modules never reach the builder.
*
!apps/api/pyproject.toml
!apps/api/uv.lock
!apps/api/alembic.ini
!apps/api/alembic/
!apps/api/app/
!apps/api/scripts/bootstrap_roles.py
!apps/api/scripts/create_org.py

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.env
**/.env.*
